Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Stable C ABI for the rofd OFD reader and renderer
 Shared library exposing the rofd OFD parsing and rendering
 functionality through a stable C ABI.

Package: librofd-ffi-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: librofd-ffi0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         libcairo2-dev
Description: Development files for the rofd C ABI
 C header and linker symlink for developing against the rofd
 OFD reader and renderer shared library. The public header
 includes cairo.h, hence the dependency on libcairo2-dev.
